   owl:annotatedTarget "PMID:23731671" ;
   rdfs:label "Wang D, Gao F (2013). Quinazoline derivatives: synthesis and bioactivities. Chem Cent J., 7(1):95. doi: 10.1186/1752-153X-7-95."
 ] .

