###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000676
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000676> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001551> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Diterpenoids with a structure based either on the taxane skeleton, or a derivative thereof. In term of phytochemistry, several derivatives of the taxane skeleton exist: 2(3->20)-abeotaxane, 3,11-cyclotaxane, 11(15->1),11(10->9)-abeotaxane, 3,8-seco-taxane, and 11(15->1)-abeotaxane, among others. More complex skeletons have been found recently, which include the taxane-derived [3.3.3] propellane ring system." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> "Diterpenes" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN-13:978-1-4398-6077-9" ,
