###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001686
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001686> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000258> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Polycyclic compounds containing the tetracyclic cucurbitane nucleus skeleton, 19-(10->9b)-abeo-10alanost-5-ene (also known as 9b-methyl-19-nor lanosta-5-ene), with a variety of oxygenation functionalities at different positions." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> "Cholesterol and derivatives" ,
