                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> "CHEMONTID:0001686" ;
                                                   rdfs:comment "Pharmacological effects of the cucurbitacins and the plants containing them are very varied: Antifertility, anti-inflammatory, bitter stimulant, cytotoxic (antitumor), hepatoprotective, purgative, stomachic. They may also play other biological roles as plant growth regulators and insect and insect feedants or antifeedants.(ASIN:B004GEAWLS)" ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Cucurbitacins" .

