###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001794
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001794> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000279> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Organic compounds containing either of the ajmalan, sarpagan skeleton, or derivative thereof. The Sarpagine (Akuammidine) group, based on the sarpagan nucleus, arises from bond formation between C-16 and C-5 of the corynantheine precursor.  Ajmaline alkaloids are based on a 17,19-secoyohimban skeleton (oxayohimban) which is invariably present as an ether." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> "organic heteropolycyclic compound" ;
