###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0002783
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0002783> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000279> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Alkaloids with a structure based on either the akuammilan skeleton. The ring system in this group is formed from a precursor of the corynantheine type by bond formation between C-16 and C-7. Variations in this subgroup include, among others, alkaloids derived by C-3 to N-4 bond fission, as well as alkaloids in which the N-4 to C-5 bond in the Akuammiline skeleton has been severed." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> "yandj" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> "2013-05-09T11:35:51Z" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> "alkaloid" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:9780412466205" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> "chemont" ;
