   owl:annotatedTarget "Diterpenoids with a structure based on the amphilectane or a seco-,neo-, or cyclo- derivative thereof. Amphilectane is a tricyclic structure made up of three cyclohexane fused together, with a methyl group at the C11-, C7-, and C3- positions. Additionally, it carries a 2-methylpropyl group at the C1-position. Amphilectanes are presumably derived from serrulatanes. Cycloamphilectanes represent a further cyclisation." ;
