                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Neolignans in which the two C6-C3 units are linked together by a bond other than Cbeta-Cbeta'. They usually consist of a 1-benzofuran or 2,3-dihydro-1-benzofuran, which is substituted a the 2-, 3-, and 5-positions with a phenyl group, a methyl group, and a propyl group, respectively." ;
