###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003424
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003424> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001604> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Lignans with a structure based on the 9,9'-epoxylignan skeleton, which consists of a tetrahydrofuran that carries two benzyl groups at the 3- and 4-positions. Additionally they are oxygenated at the 2-position to form dibenzylbutyrolactones (oxo group) or a dibenzylbutyrolactols (hydroxyl group)." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> "yandj" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> "2014-04-04T17:42:42Z" ;
