###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003494
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003494> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001551> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Diterpenoids with a structure based on one the rhamnofolane or daphnane skeleton. The rhamnofolane and daphnane skeletons are closely related, being formally derived from casbane by two cyclizations (6,10 and 5,14) followed by cleavage of the 1,15 (daphnane) or 2,15 (rhamnofolane) cyclopropane bonds." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> "yandj" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> "2014-04-14T17:47:38Z" ;
