###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003550
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003550> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0001551> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Diterpenoids with a structure that is based either on the pachydictyane or the cneorubin skeleton. Pachydictyane is a bicyclic compound consisting of a guaiane skeleton that carries a prenyl group attached to the C12 carbon atom. Cneorubin is a tricyclic compound consisting of a cycloprop[e]azulene where the cyclopropane carries a methyl group and a 4-methylpentyl group." ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> "yandj" ;
                                                   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> "2014-04-24T12:21:50Z" ;
