                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000002> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Organic heteropolycyclic compounds containing a pyrazine ring fused to an imidazole ring. These also include hydrogenated derivatives of the imidazopyrazine moiety. Imidazole is 5-membered ring consisting of three carbon atoms, and two nitrogen centers at the 1- and 3-positions. Pyrazine is a 6-membered ring consisting of six carbon atoms and two nitrogen centers at ring positions 1 and 4." ;
