###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003759
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0003759> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEMONTID_0000279> ;
                                                   <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Alkaloids with a structure that is based on the tetracyclic macroline skeleton. The macroline skeleton arises by scission of the C-21 to N-4 bond  of the akuammilan skeleton, and mostly occurs in bisindole alkaloids." ;
