                                                   rdfs:comment "The ability of garlic and related allyl sulfur compounds to block tumors in the colon, lung, breast, and liver suggests general mechanisms that are not tissue specific. It is well known that allyl sulfur compounds can modulate drug metabolism systems, especially various phase II detoxifying enzymes." ;
